    "content": "\n      <p class=\"article-lead\">We have crossed the rubicon where text generation costs have approached zero. As a consequence, the economic value of generic informational content has collapsed, while the premium on human synthesis, lived experience, and verifiable craft has never been higher.</p>\n\n      <h2>The Provenance Spectrum</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Human Primary Source:</strong> Original investigative journalism, field interviews, and personal memoir.</li>\n        <li><strong>Human-Synthesized AI Assist:</strong> Data extraction, mathematical modeling, and stylistic polishing guided line-by-line by human editors.</li>\n        <li><strong>Machine Synthesized:</strong> Automated market summaries and real-time sensor transcribing, strictly badged with algorithmic disclosures.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Designing for Intellectual Accountability</h2>\n      <p>Trust is not granted by algorithmic accuracy benchmarks; it is earned through radical humility, explicit disclosures, and inspectable editorial trails.</p>\n    "
